      "total": "21 residual specifications plus the unadjusted active baseline. Calibration-only has no rolling-window duplication.",
      "selection": "Lowest development MAE, thenRMSE,then fewer feature columns,then stable ID. Baseline participates, so no change can win. Freeze selection before scoring later-period outcomes. No post-validation reselection."
    },
    "metrics": {
